  "nameEn": "Night Round with Functions",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Function \"Block side\": while there is no obstacle — a step and the chain \"if sparking — repair and light; else if lamp — light; else — take\". Call it on every side.",
  "descriptionEn": "A block along its perimeter: sparking lamps, lamps without bulbs and items on the ground. One side is one function, and the whole block is four calls of it.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Function \"Block side\": while there is no obstacle — a step and the chain \"if sparking — repair; else if lamp is shining — turn off; else — take\". Call it on every side."
